1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,875
[CAM Wide]
CUBY: Hey! I'm Cuby.
I'm a cube, obviously.

2
00:00:01,875 --> 00:00:03,750
SPHERO: I'm Sphero!
Round, zero corners!

3
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:05,625
[CAM Cuby]
CUBY: We're super
low-effort models.

4
00:00:05,625 --> 00:00:07,500
[CAM Sphero]
SPHERO: Just primitives
and a dream!

5
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,375
[CAM Cuby]
CUBY: But subtitles?
Real 3D geometry!

6
00:00:09,375 --> 00:00:11,250
[CAM Sphero]
SPHERO: They type live,
letter by letter!

7
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:13,125
[CAM Cuby]
CUBY: Drag my keyframes
in the Timeline!

8
00:00:13,125 --> 00:00:15,000
[CAM Wide]
BOTH: One more thing -
pick a robot!

9
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
[CAM Wide]
Who gets the last word?

10
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,875
[CAM Cuby]
CUBY: Cubes rule!
Six sides of awesome.

11
00:00:18,875 --> 00:00:20,750
CUBY: Count my corners:
eight! All mine!

12
00:00:20,750 --> 00:00:22,500
CUBY: Stay square,
friend!

13
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,875
[CAM Sphero]
SPHERO: Spheres supreme!
Zero corners, zero fear!

14
00:00:24,875 --> 00:00:26,750
SPHERO: I roll everywhere.
Beats walking!

15
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:28,500
SPHERO: Stay round!
See you!
